        "created_at": "2012-11-29T23:58:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello:</p><p>I am new to the forum and also just completed my first game. I had one situatoin I can't get my min around. I believe this may have already been answered but I am still unclear as to how to resolve. Tempest was the third player and had played Shielding Winds as the&nbsp;third card. Haka was the second player and had Ta Moko out as the second card and also had the most hit points. T-Rex came out as an enviroment card. How much damage does Haka take. Is it 2 or 4? Does the player order matter? Does the position of the card played by the Hero matter? I need this reduced to simple logic that even I can understand. Overall, I was very happly how well the game flowed and I am looking forward to many more plays. Thanks.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
