        "id": 47399,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-30T00:28:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Some would say that, if Shielding Wind were played before Ta Moko, it would activate first (as it was played first), thus giving the most protection.&nbsp; Others would say that Ta Moko is a static, always in effect modifier, while Shielding Wind is a triggered effect modifier, and the damage would have already been reduced to 4 before Shielding Wind has a chance to protect.&nbsp; I'll leave it alone after this.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:20:53.057Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
