        "id": 47400,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-30T09:20:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I don't pay attention to card order when it comes to heroes, I'd say Shielding Winds would reduce the damage first, since <span class=\"bbcode-i\">a</span> hero is gonna be hit for five or more damage, causing it to kick in. Then, you look and see that said hero will be Haka, who has a -1 damage modifier up. So the damage he takes is further reduced by one, reducing his total damage taken in that hit to two.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:20:53.133Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
