        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "As I don&#39;t pay attention to card order when it comes to heroes, I&#39;d say Shielding Winds would reduce the damage first, since [i]a[/i] hero is gonna be hit for five or more damage, causing it to kick in. Then, you look and see that said hero will be Haka, who has a -1 damage modifier up. So the damage he takes is further reduced by one, reducing his total damage taken in that hit to two.\n",
